msgid ""
"Windows wants to check its drive first. It does that by itself the next time it starts."
msgstr ""
"Windows wil eerst zijn schijf controleren. Dat doet het vanzelf bij de volgende start."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7547
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Start Windows once, and Monet Bridge hands its recovery key over: Monet opens it by itself from then on. Or type the key here."
msgstr ""
"De Windows-schijf is versleuteld met BitLocker. Start Windows één keer, dan geeft Monet Bridge de herstelsleutel door: Monet opent hem daarna zelf. Of typ de sleutel hier."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7548
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key once, and Monet opens it at every start, for games, files and Wi-Fi in both."
msgstr ""
"De schijf van Windows is versleuteld met BitLocker. Typ de herstelsleutel één keer, en Monet opent de schijf bij elke start, voor games, bestanden en wifi in allebei."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7549
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is open. Monet Bridge installs itself the next time Windows starts, and from then on games, files and Wi-Fi work in both."
msgstr ""
"De schijf van Windows is open. Monet Bridge installeert zichzelf de volgende keer dat Windows start, en vanaf dan werken games, bestanden en wifi in allebei."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7550
msgid "Windows' drive couldn't be opened this time."
msgstr "De schijf van Windows kon deze keer niet worden geopend."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7551
